    "chunk_text": "sunu mid sceamleasum anginne arn into me, ac se encgel hine afylde, and \u00f0am deofle \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se heahgerefa to \u00f0am halgan m\u00e6dene, \u00fein saga bi\u00f0 geswutelod gif \u00feu \u00feone sylfan encgel Agnes seo eadige him andwyrde \u00feus, Ne synd ge na wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t wundor to geseonne, ac swa \u00feeah is Ga\u00f0 eow nu \u00feeah ealle ut, \u00fe\u00e6t ic me ana gebidde. Hi eodon \u00fea ealle ut, and heo hi ana geb\u00e6d, biddende hire drihten \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feone deadan ar\u00e6rde. \u00dea \u00e6teowde \u00fe\u00e6r Cristes encgel, and \u00feone cniht ar\u00e6rde. And he arn \u00fe\u00e6rrihte ut, \u00fea he geedcucod w\u00e6s, clypigende ofer eall, and cw\u00e6\u00f0ende \u00feus, An God is on Hi ne magon him sylfum fremian, ne o\u00f0rum fultumian. \u00dea wurdon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0engyldan hetelice gedrefede, and clypodon mid gehlyde be \u00f0am geleaffullan \u00dea ne dorste se heahgerefa naht ongean \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0engyldan, ac forlet his gingran togeanes \u00fe\u00e6re ceaste, Hw\u00e6t \u00fea Aspasius se undergerefa ne mihte wi\u00f0cw\u00e6\u00f0an \u00feam cwealmb\u00e6rum folce, ac het \u00fea ontendan Hit wear\u00f0 \u00fea swa gedon, swa se w\u00e6lhreowa het, ac se lig hine tod\u00e6lde on twegen d\u00e6las sona, and And Agnes seo eadige stod on \u00e6lemiddan gesund, astr\u00e6htum handum \u00feus hi gebiddende, Eala \u00f0u Efne ic eom begoten mid godcundlicum deawe, \u00fe\u00e6s lig",
